ision calls).\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Eager end-of-turn threshold\", \"default\": 0.6, \"advanced\": true}}',0,'active',1,'2026-08-07 05:46:16','2026-08-07 11:26:58',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Deepgram Flux English-only conversational STT (/v2/listen) with model-integrated turn detection. Use flux-general-multi for Hindi/Hinglish callers.'),('pm_bd7328e54842','elevenlabs','tts','eleven_turbo_v2_5','Eleven Turbo v2.5 (deprecated)','[\"en\", \"hi\", \"ta\", \"ja\", \"zh\", \"de\", \"fr\", \"ko\", \"pt\", \"it\", \"es\", \"id\", \"nl\", \"tr\", \"fil\", \"pl\", \"sv\", \"bg\", \"ro\", \"ar\", \"cs\", \"el\", \"fi\", \"hr\", \"ms\", \"sk\", \"da\", \"uk\", \"ru\", \"hu\", \"no\", \"vi\"]','[\"pcm\", \"ulaw\", \"alaw\"]','[8000, 16000, 22050, 24000]',1,'{\"speed\": {\"max\": 1.2, \"min\": 0.7, \"help\": \"Playback speed multiplier.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Speed\", \"default\": 1.0}, \"style\": {\"max\": 1.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"Style exaggeration. 0 is fastest and most stable.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Style\", \"default\": 0.0}, \"auto_mode\": {\"help\": \"Generate immediately per sentence instead of server-side buffering. Recommended when sending complete sentences (this platform does).\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"label\": \"Auto mode\", \"default\": true}, \"stability\": {\"max\": 1.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"Lower values give more expressive, varied delivery; higher values are steadier.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Stability\", \"default\": 0.0}, \"sync_alignment\": {\"help\": \"Deliver character timing data in sync with audio chunks.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"label\": \"Sync alignment\", \"default\": false, \"advanced\": true}, \"similarity_boost\": {\"max\": 1.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"How closely synthesis adheres to the original voice timbre.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Similarity boost\", \"default\": 1.0}, \"use_speaker_boost\": {\"help\": \"Boosts similarity to the original speaker at a small latency cost.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"label\": \"Speaker boost\", \"default\": true}, \"inactivity_timeout\": {\"max\": 180, \"min\": 20, \"help\": \"Server-side idle timeout for the streaming connection.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Inactivity timeout (s)\", \"default\": 60, \"advanced\": true}, \"chunk_length_schedule\": {\"max\": 500, \"min\": 50, \"help\": \"Character thresholds that trigger generation when auto mode is off.\", \"type\": \"int_list\", \"label\": \"Chunk schedule\", \"default\": [120, 160, 250, 290], \"advanced\": true, \"max_items\": 8}, \"apply_text_normalization\": {\"help\": \"Normalize numbers/abbreviations before synthesis.\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"label\": \"Text normalization\", \"values\": [\"auto\", \"on\", \"off\"], \"default\": \"auto\", \"advanced\": true}}',0,'inactive',1,'2026-07-21 18:25:14','2026-07-21 18:25:14',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Deprecated quality/latency-balance model (32 languages). Superseded by Eleven Flash v2.5.'),('pm_c27a122ea170423786bf','openai','llm','gpt-5','GPT-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'{\"streaming\": {\"help\": \"Token streaming into the sentence buffer. Always on for realtime voice.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"fixed\": true, \"label\": \"Streaming\", \"default\": true}, \"max_tokens\": {\"max\": 4096, \"min\": 16, \"help\": \"Upper bound per reply. Voice replies should stay short.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max output tokens\", \"default\": 256}, \"max_retries\": {\"max\": 5, \"min\": 0, \"help\": \"Automatic retries on transient failures.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max retries\", \"default\": 1, \"advanced\": true}, \"temperature\": {\"max\": 2.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"Response randomness. Keep low for voice bots.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Temperature\", \"default\": 0.3}, \"timeout_seconds\": {\"max\": 120, \"min\": 5, \"help\": \"Per-request timeout before retry/fallback handling.\", \"step\": 1, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Timeout (s)\", \"default\": 30, \"advanced\": true}}',0,'inactive',9,'2026-07-31 13:07:33','2026-07-31 13:07:33',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'GPT-5 general-purpose model. Catalogued for pricing but inactive: the OpenAI LLM provider still sends `max_tokens`/temperature, which the GPT-5 family rejects. Activate only after the provider is updated.'),('pm_c436d6eafc9f','sarvam','stt','saaras:v3','Saaras v3 (streaming)','[\"unknown\", \"hi-IN\", \"en-IN\", \"bn-IN\", \"mr-IN\", \"gu-IN\", \"ta-IN\", \"te-IN\", \"kn-IN\", \"ml-IN\", \"pa-IN\", \"od-IN\", \"as-IN\", \"ur-IN\", \"ne-IN\", \"kok-IN\", \"ks-IN\", \"sd-IN\", \"sa-IN\", \"sat-IN\", \"mni-IN\", \"brx-IN\", \"mai-IN\", \"doi-IN\"]','[\"linear16\"]','[8000, 16000]',1,'{\"mode\": {\"help\": \"saaras:v3 output mode. \'transcribe\' is standard; \'translate\' returns English.\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"label\": \"Mode\", \"values\": [\"transcribe\", \"verbatim\", \"translit\", \"codemix\", \"translate\"], \"default\": \"transcribe\"}, \"vad_signals\": {\"help\": \"Emit start/end-of-speech events from Sarvam\'s server-side VAD.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"label\": \"VAD signals\", \"default\": true}, \"input_encoding\": {\"help\": \"Wire encoding for microphone/telephony audio sent to Sarvam.\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"label\": \"Input encoding\", \"values\": [\"pcm_s16le\", \"wav\"], \"default\": \"pcm_s16le\", \"advanced\": true}, \"timeout_seconds\": {\"max\": 120, \"min\": 5, \"help\": \"Connection/response timeout before the turn is failed.\", \"step\": 1, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Timeout (s)\", \"default\": 30, \"advanced\": true}, \"min_speech_frames\": {\"max\": 50, \"min\": 1, \"help\": \"Consecutive speech frames required to open a segment.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Min speech frames\", \"default\": 2, \"advanced\": true}, \"auto_detect_language\": {\"help\": \"Auto-detect every utterance language. Keep off for phone calls with 